          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha mwana Ahiya uwa mu luko lwakwa Isaka amwimina no kuya mwipaya ku Gibetoni, umusumba wa Bafilisiti, ninshi Nadabu na bena Israeli bonse bali pakuupoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha aipeye Nadabu mu mwaka wabutatu uwa bufumu bwakwa Asa imfumu ya bena Yuda, amupyana na pa bufumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 14:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo atampafye ukuteeka, aipaya aba mu ŋanda yakwa Yeroboamu bonse. Tashilepo nangu umo uwamweo pa bakwa Yeroboamu, lelo alofyafye bonse pakukonka ishiwi lyakwa Yawe ilyapeelwe ukupitila mu mubomfi wakwe Ahiya umwina Shiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi fyacitike pa mulandu wa fyabubifi Yeroboamu acitile, no kuwikishamo abena Israeli ukuficita kabili alenga nokuti Yawe Lesa wakwa Israeli akalipe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
